    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Defining cytogenetic abnormalities:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Complex karyotype (at least three <span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">abnormalities)<sup>a</sup></span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">5q&nbsp;deletion or loss of&nbsp;5q due to unbalanced translocation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Monosomy&nbsp;7, 7q&nbsp;deletion, or loss of&nbsp;7q due to unbalanced translocation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">11q&nbsp;deletion</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">12p&nbsp;deletion or loss of&nbsp;12p due to unbalanced translocation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Monosomy&nbsp;13 or 13q&nbsp;deletion</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">17p&nbsp;deletion or loss of&nbsp;17p due to unbalanced translocation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Isochromosome&nbsp;17q</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">idic(X)(q13)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Defining somatic mutations:</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 395.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"527\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">ASXL1</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">BCOR</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">EZH2</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">SF3B1</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">SRSF2</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">STAG2</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">U2AF1</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><em><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">ZRSR2</span></em></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">a</span></sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">The</span> International System for Human Cytogenomic Nomenclature (ISCN) should be used to determine the number of chromosomal abnormalities necessary to meet the criteria for a complex karyotype <span class=\"Ref-misc\">[[McGowan-Jordan J, Hastings RJ, Moore S, editors. ISCN 2020: an international system for human cytogenomic nomenclature (2020). Basel (Switzerland): Karger Publishers; 2020.]]</span>, using the following guidelines:</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Only clonal abnormalities are counted; abnormalities present in only one metaphase are ignored.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Numerical gains and losses, simple and complex balanced translocations, unbalanced aberrations involving one chromosome, and multiplication of a complete chromosome set are counted as one abnormality.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Unbalanced aberrations involving two or more chromosomes, tetrasomy of the same chromosome, triplication or quadruplication, and isoderivative chromosomes are counted as two abnormalities.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Constitutional abnormalities are not counted.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>In the case of multiple clones (subclones or independent clones), chromosomal abnormalities in each clone/subclone are counted separately, and the number of chromosomal abnormalities is defined by the clone with the highest number of abnormalities.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">6.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>For composite karyotypes, clonal chromosomal aberrations are counted in metaphases with the highest number of abnormalities.</p>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  }
]